stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> PENDING : enqueued with the upload
    PENDING --> RUNNING : claimed (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    RUNNING --> DONE : processed
    RUNNING --> PENDING : retryable failure, after 30 s, 60 s, 120 s…
    RUNNING --> PENDING : worker crashed (stale after 10 min)
    RUNNING --> FAILED : permanent failure or 3 attempts used
    DONE --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
